WEBVTT

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:30.930
Everything looks okay, right?

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:35.030
Recipes He'll Love

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:35.030
Daily Repertoire

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:09.740
Saito-san.

00:02:10.550 --> 00:02:15.060
"The (Moon) Sways by the Poolside"

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:12.810
Saito Himea-san?

00:02:13.180 --> 00:02:15.200
She's probably on the roof again?

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:17.470
She came to class this 
morning, at least.

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:20.100
Again? This could be a problem.

00:02:20.470 --> 00:02:23.350
Saito-san never comes to class.

00:02:23.350 --> 00:02:25.900
She's definitely getting 
special treatment.

00:02:28.050 --> 00:02:29.510
Himea...

00:02:45.110 --> 00:02:48.340
I wish class would be over sooner...

00:02:59.220 --> 00:03:01.240
It was so anticlimactic.

00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:15.630
A nine-year vendetta 
over, just like that?

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:19.870
Yet another demonstration of my genius.

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:25.140
Man, I'm starving!

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:27.580
We need to hurry, or they'll 
be out of croquette sandwiches!

00:03:43.940 --> 00:03:48.070
Scum! You dare to interrupt my meal?

00:03:48.530 --> 00:03:49.260
Mirai!

00:03:51.100 --> 00:03:53.050
Whoa! What's that?!

00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:55.390
A bug? A really big bug?

00:03:56.770 --> 00:03:59.150
Wait a moment. What are you doing?

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:03.320
What? Without any warning?

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:12.600
The curse is lifted!

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:15.440
Time for a fully charged Andu-Mirai!

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:21.030
Dispose of that thing!

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:24.920
Okay, time for lunch.

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:29.710
Hey, Taito. Are you going to 
the cafeteria to buy lunch?

00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:36.510
Um, I was wondering if you were going 
to buy a croquette sandwich for lunch.

00:04:36.510 --> 00:04:39.540
For lunch? Yeah, I guess.

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:41.180
That was the plan.

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:43.740
Well, you see...

00:04:43.740 --> 00:04:45.720
I happened to wake up early today.

00:04:47.150 --> 00:04:51.890
And I got all fired up 
about making my lunch,

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:53.640
but I ended up making too much.

00:04:56.730 --> 00:05:00.530
So I fixed you up a lunch as well!

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:01.740
Are you serious?

00:05:01.740 --> 00:05:03.720
He's cheating on her with Saito-san!

00:05:03.720 --> 00:05:05.910
That evil bastard!

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:08.000
He's an enemy to women everywhere!

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:10.260
I'm gonna kill him!

00:05:10.260 --> 00:05:12.210
Poor Haruka...

00:05:16.320 --> 00:05:17.820
You should thank me.

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:18.960
Is Taito here?

00:05:19.570 --> 00:05:22.230
Let's have lunch together again!

00:05:23.220 --> 00:05:27.330
Gekkou gave me money, so I 
bought croquette sandwiches!

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:30.630
Himea...?

00:05:34.820 --> 00:05:37.410
Uh, this is, well...

00:05:39.950 --> 00:05:43.090
I'm dead. I can feel their 
eyes boring holes through me.

00:05:43.090 --> 00:05:45.820
Hey, Taito. Where do 
you want to eat lunch?

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:49.500
One of the benches in the courtyard? 
Or should we go to the roof?

00:05:50.710 --> 00:05:53.880
Uh, well... You see, Himea...

00:05:56.110 --> 00:05:57.910
Time-out!

00:05:57.110 --> 00:05:57.910
Gekkou the Annoying Idiot

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:00.400
Hello? What is it?

00:06:00.400 --> 00:06:01.820
Get your ass down here.

00:06:01.820 --> 00:06:04.250
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:06.420
I don't have time for you right now.

00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:08.920
Do I need to dumb it 
down for you, trash?

00:06:08.920 --> 00:06:10.430
Who are you calling trash?!

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:12.440
Is there someone else on this call?

00:06:12.440 --> 00:06:17.000
Cut the crap! Why should 
I let you boss me around?!

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:19.770
A slave is supposed to 
obey his master's orders.

00:06:20.030 --> 00:06:22.760
You're the one who made me a 
member of the student council.

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:24.440
I never agreed to it!

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:26.610
I never asked for your opinion.

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:29.150
Bastard... Who do you think you are?

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:30.080
A genius.

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:34.950
Damn that Gekkou!

00:06:35.230 --> 00:06:38.590
R-Really? That sounds 
rough, Kurenai-kun.

00:06:38.590 --> 00:06:41.140
I understand. I'll be right there.

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:46.480
Sorry, Haruka. The student council 
president wants to see me.

00:06:46.480 --> 00:06:48.110
He said some urgent work came up.

00:06:49.240 --> 00:06:52.530
Thanks for the lunch. I'll eat it later.

00:06:52.530 --> 00:06:54.850
Oh, I see...

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:58.650
That's right. You're on 
the student council now.

00:06:58.650 --> 00:07:01.080
I don't want to keep you then.

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:03.870
Y-Yeah! Busy, busy!

00:07:03.870 --> 00:07:05.070
Come on, Himea!

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:07.900
What? What's going on?

00:07:13.180 --> 00:07:16.340
These croquette sandwiches are so good.

00:07:16.340 --> 00:07:20.660
I expected human food 
to be crude and yucky,

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:23.750
but I love everything 
you've shown me so far!

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:24.790
Himea...

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:29.650
Well, when we defeated Hinata...

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:33.550
I died, right...

00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:45.060
Attention all students.

00:07:45.700 --> 00:07:48.820
All afternoon classes and 
after-school activities

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:51.200
have been canceled due to inspections.

00:07:52.190 --> 00:07:54.110
I repeat.

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:56.360
All afternoon classes and 
after-school activities

00:07:56.360 --> 00:07:58.080
have been canceled due to inspections.

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:01.470
All students should leave 
the school building at once.

00:08:01.470 --> 00:08:04.290
What? We were supposed 
to swim this afternoon!

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:08.000
You perv! You just wanted 
to see girls in swimsuits!

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:16.200
A sudden cancellation?

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:23.780
Whoa! What's that?!

00:08:23.780 --> 00:08:26.790
Oh, that's unusual. They're dyltiklis.

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:28.750
Dyl-what?

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:30.100
Dyltiklis.

00:08:30.100 --> 00:08:33.310
Insects from the 7th 
dimension of Hearse.

00:08:33.310 --> 00:08:35.400
Oh, I see.

00:08:39.730 --> 00:08:44.120
Himea, do these things attack humans?

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:45.510
Uh-huh, they're carnivores.

00:08:45.510 --> 00:08:48.760
They're thrilled about 
the feast around them.

00:08:49.350 --> 00:08:50.950
Oh, sure. Of course.

00:08:53.730 --> 00:08:55.510
That settles it.

00:08:57.520 --> 00:08:59.300
Zap away!

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:01.650
Don't run away!

00:09:01.650 --> 00:09:04.330
Oh, that's how you wanna 
play? Take this then!

00:09:06.810 --> 00:09:10.330
Man, thought I was gonna die...

00:09:10.330 --> 00:09:12.180
Actually, I did die.

00:09:12.710 --> 00:09:15.010
Still, you were so cool out there.

00:09:15.010 --> 00:09:17.300
You're late. I sentence you to death.

00:09:17.300 --> 00:09:18.940
I already died...

00:09:18.940 --> 00:09:20.680
Whoa! What's that?!

00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:23.950
Are you blind, you pathetic monkey?

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:25.330
Take this!

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:29.580
I'll end you with my 
Final Finish Last Zappy!

00:09:33.520 --> 00:09:35.220
What's going on...

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:38.990
Did you deal with the insect 
scum that got outside?

00:09:38.990 --> 00:09:42.190
I wouldn't be here otherwise.

00:09:42.190 --> 00:09:44.960
I ordered the principal 
to send the students home,

00:09:44.960 --> 00:09:47.040
but it seems that it wasn't necessary.

00:09:47.040 --> 00:09:48.810
Hey, did you see that?

00:09:48.810 --> 00:09:51.550
My zapping is awesome!

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:53.790
Hey...

00:09:54.420 --> 00:09:57.370
What's up with this school?

00:10:05.430 --> 00:10:09.690
Um, why did you summon me here?

00:10:09.690 --> 00:10:12.630
I'm allowing you the privilege of 
explaining what this school is about.

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:13.910
You should be grateful.

00:10:14.230 --> 00:10:18.790
Yikes, you act like that towards adults?

00:10:18.790 --> 00:10:20.730
So who is she?

00:10:20.730 --> 00:10:22.380
Suzae Saeko.

00:10:22.380 --> 00:10:24.020
An officer from the military.

00:10:24.020 --> 00:10:25.450
You mean the JSDF?

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:26.820
Or the Americans?

00:10:26.820 --> 00:10:28.230
Neither.

00:10:28.900 --> 00:10:32.360
We are a magic-oriented organization 
that operates above a national level.

00:10:33.090 --> 00:10:37.470
Our authority trumps the police, the 
JSDF, and even the government...

00:10:37.470 --> 00:10:40.460
The inept are always quick 
to hide behind authority.

00:10:41.460 --> 00:10:44.490
They work with the people 
who are chasing after me.

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:45.600
Seriously?!

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:51.600
I love it when you say that.

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:53.890
Huh? Uh, well..

00:10:53.890 --> 00:10:56.230
You're asking if it's true, right?

00:10:57.100 --> 00:10:59.420
Then yes, seriously.

00:11:00.890 --> 00:11:03.830
Don't forget that the military's barrier

00:11:03.830 --> 00:11:09.550
is what's preventing the church and 
Temperon Crowley from finding you.

00:11:09.550 --> 00:11:11.350
Yes, I won't forget.

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:15.480
And I won't forget what the 
military and church did to me.

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:18.490
Taito!

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:22.510
Saitohimea is nothing more 
than an empty husk now.

00:11:22.770 --> 00:11:25.230
Does the military still want her?

00:11:25.230 --> 00:11:28.080
We will be the ones who determine 
if she holds any value.

00:11:28.460 --> 00:11:32.370
Taito! Let me see Taito!

00:11:33.950 --> 00:11:36.320
We do not care if she holds any value.

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:39.660
As a criminal who sided with Ba'alskra,

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:42.460
she shall be banished to 
the void for all eternity.

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:46.400
That is the church's decision.

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:51.390
Himea.

00:11:52.570 --> 00:11:54.060
What's wrong, Himea?

00:11:54.390 --> 00:11:55.730
Are you feeling sick?

00:11:56.160 --> 00:11:58.290
Nope, it's nothing.

00:11:59.730 --> 00:12:02.410
I'm sure that you've realized 
this, Kurogane-kun,

00:12:02.690 --> 00:12:06.030
but there are multiple 
worlds in existence.

00:12:06.310 --> 00:12:08.790
Such as the world where the 
witch Saitohimea comes from

00:12:09.470 --> 00:12:11.600
and the world where the 
demon Andu-Mirai comes from.

00:12:11.600 --> 00:12:14.890
That's Daughter of Indra, Andu-Mirai!

00:12:15.940 --> 00:12:20.330
And the demonic world where the 
Daughter of Indra, Andu-Mirai comes from.

00:12:20.740 --> 00:12:24.550
There are countless others.

00:12:25.190 --> 00:12:28.900
These worlds are linked 
by dimensional rifts.

00:12:29.270 --> 00:12:32.080
You must pass through these rifts

00:12:32.080 --> 00:12:33.990
to reach different worlds.

00:12:34.760 --> 00:12:37.870
The different dimensions all intersect

00:12:37.870 --> 00:12:39.940
here at Miyasaka High School.

00:12:40.680 --> 00:12:42.210
Got it, trash?

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:46.310
No, I have no idea what 
you're talking about.

00:12:46.310 --> 00:12:48.260
What the hell!?

00:12:48.260 --> 00:12:51.430
I labeled you as a monkey, but 
I must retract that statement.

00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:54.210
You are a flea.

00:13:00.230 --> 00:13:01.460
Taito...

00:13:05.140 --> 00:13:09.140
Miyasaka High School was 
established by the military

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:11.250
as a facility for monitoring 
the intersection of dimensions.

00:13:11.250 --> 00:13:13.000
Why a school?

00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:18.270
Only those under the age of 18 are 
able to pass through the rifts.

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:28.410
Genius = Gekkou   Flea = Immortal guy

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:20.910
We don't know the reason,

00:13:20.910 --> 00:13:24.960
but once you pass that age, you 
are barred from the holy land.

00:13:24.960 --> 00:13:25.850
The holy land?

00:13:26.190 --> 00:13:28.900
That's what the military calls 
those dimensional rifts.

00:13:28.900 --> 00:13:31.180
The student council's responsibility is

00:13:31.180 --> 00:13:32.580
to monitor the holy land

00:13:32.840 --> 00:13:36.600
and eliminate the occasional intruder.

00:13:38.840 --> 00:13:41.310
In return, student council members

00:13:41.310 --> 00:13:44.110
are freed from their obligations 
as students, including classes.

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:48.200
The principal and all school 
faculty are aware of this.

00:13:48.830 --> 00:13:52.220
However, they don't know the 
truth about this school.

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:53.630
Ah...

00:13:53.630 --> 00:13:55.470
Explanation's finished.

00:13:55.470 --> 00:13:57.380
Never ask about this again.

00:13:59.050 --> 00:14:00.460
Hey, Gekkou!

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:04.540
If afternoon classes are canceled, 
that means gym is canceled?

00:14:04.540 --> 00:14:07.250
Does that mean we don't get to swim?

00:14:07.250 --> 00:14:08.520
Obviously.

00:14:08.520 --> 00:14:11.320
No way! I wanna swim!

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:17.800
See? I'm ready to go!

00:14:17.800 --> 00:14:20.570
Oh, she's wearing a swimsuit.

00:14:20.570 --> 00:14:22.340
Stop that, Taito!

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:25.460
Hey, Gekkou! Let's go to the pool!

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:27.150
The pool!

00:14:27.150 --> 00:14:27.720
Taito!

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:30.430
Ow! Ow! Himea!

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:31.700
Himea?

00:14:31.700 --> 00:14:37.100
I'll have to kill every other girl out 
there so you don't get distracted.

00:14:39.780 --> 00:14:44.470
Um... Can I leave?

00:14:49.740 --> 00:14:51.170
Gekkou!

00:14:51.580 --> 00:14:53.370
Taito!

00:14:55.610 --> 00:14:57.300
Aren't you hot?

00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:03.630
I understand what this school is about,

00:15:04.060 --> 00:15:05.920
but I have one more question.

00:15:06.470 --> 00:15:10.760
Why were you fighting 
against your twin brother?

00:15:12.620 --> 00:15:14.950
He tried to kill me.

00:15:14.950 --> 00:15:17.110
I returned the favor.

00:15:18.110 --> 00:15:19.020
That's all.

00:15:19.670 --> 00:15:21.630
Still, that's just wrong...

00:15:22.040 --> 00:15:23.700
It's none of your business.

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:24.660
But...

00:15:25.910 --> 00:15:27.530
What was that for?!

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:29.760
The water feels great, Gekkou!

00:15:29.760 --> 00:15:31.490
Join us, Taito!

00:15:33.230 --> 00:15:36.000
Okay! I get it, so stop tugging!

00:15:37.640 --> 00:15:39.560
Mirai-chan Attack!

00:15:42.130 --> 00:15:43.510
Are you trying to kill me?!

00:15:43.510 --> 00:15:46.040
You're immortal, so it 
doesn't matter if you drown!

00:15:48.570 --> 00:15:51.780
O-Okay... I won't hold back then...

00:15:51.780 --> 00:15:53.970
Himea-chan Attack!

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:55.230
Himea!

00:15:56.240 --> 00:15:59.470
I'm gonna die!

00:16:02.090 --> 00:16:05.080
Let's see who can stay 
underwater longer!

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:07.000
I won't lose!

00:16:09.800 --> 00:16:11.560
Hinata and I...

00:16:11.560 --> 00:16:14.100
We were always together.

00:16:14.100 --> 00:16:16.480
Or else we would fall apart.

00:16:17.520 --> 00:16:22.360
That was how I felt, and I believed 
that Hinata felt the same way.

00:16:23.350 --> 00:16:24.790
Until that day came...

00:16:31.830 --> 00:16:32.860
Mom?

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:35.430
Dad?

00:16:37.290 --> 00:16:38.680
Hello, brother.

00:16:39.160 --> 00:16:40.310
You're early.

00:16:41.390 --> 00:16:42.620
Hinata...

00:16:42.620 --> 00:16:46.060
Hey, can you see this?

00:16:48.550 --> 00:16:50.580
Oh, you can't?

00:16:51.120 --> 00:16:53.570
Then I don't need you.

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:55.940
I'll be leaving now.

00:16:57.130 --> 00:16:58.250
What is this?

00:16:59.380 --> 00:17:01.550
What are you doing?

00:17:01.550 --> 00:17:05.540
I sacrificed Mom and Dad to 
form a nine-year contract.

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:08.690
This should be a pretty long journey.

00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:10.800
Contract?

00:17:11.730 --> 00:17:12.690
Journey?

00:17:13.200 --> 00:17:14.610
What are you talking about?

00:17:14.610 --> 00:17:15.950
I'll let you live

00:17:16.490 --> 00:17:18.220
for nine more years.

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:19.790
Nine years?

00:17:19.790 --> 00:17:22.380
Enjoy the remainder of your life.

00:17:22.750 --> 00:17:23.970
Hinata.

00:17:24.660 --> 00:17:26.100
Wait, Hinata!

00:17:28.590 --> 00:17:29.720
Nine years?

00:17:36.010 --> 00:17:37.290
Time's running out?

00:17:39.170 --> 00:17:41.930
My nine years are running out!

00:17:45.940 --> 00:17:47.320
That's absurd!

00:17:47.880 --> 00:17:51.690
Hinata, my younger brother, 
wants to kill me?!

00:17:51.950 --> 00:17:54.690
That's not funny! I won't let it happen!

00:17:58.520 --> 00:18:01.470
So? Are you here to kill me?

00:18:02.330 --> 00:18:04.770
No, I'm here to eat you!

00:18:05.260 --> 00:18:08.670
Hinata offered you as a sacrifice.

00:18:09.170 --> 00:18:11.730
So your life belongs to me!

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:16.300
S-So you were

00:18:16.300 --> 00:18:18.770
sent by Hinata to kill Gekkou?

00:18:18.770 --> 00:18:21.970
Uh-huh. He used a magic 
circle to summon me.

00:18:21.970 --> 00:18:25.040
But Gekkou attacked me first.

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:26.730
He got on top of me.

00:18:27.050 --> 00:18:29.390
On top...?

00:18:29.390 --> 00:18:32.380
And then he stabbed me to 
stop me from fighting back

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:33.730
and took off my clothes.

00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:38.240
Get ready!

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:42.330
I've been ready for a long time.

00:18:43.020 --> 00:18:46.680
You think that I spent the 
past nine years doing nothing?

00:18:50.780 --> 00:18:52.380
Foolish human!

00:18:52.380 --> 00:18:55.560
My lightning will burn you to a crisp!

00:18:55.560 --> 00:18:57.940
Exorcise: Spell Error!

00:18:58.420 --> 00:19:00.460
What? W-Wait!

00:19:00.460 --> 00:19:01.010
I won't wait!

00:19:01.010 --> 00:19:02.220
That's no fair! Time-out!

00:19:02.220 --> 00:19:03.380
Silence, trash!

00:19:07.990 --> 00:19:09.970
Wh-Why?!

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:12.840
Why can't I use my power?

00:19:12.840 --> 00:19:15.500
Spell Error exorcises 
all kinds of power.

00:19:15.860 --> 00:19:18.610
Trash like you stand no chance.

00:19:19.450 --> 00:19:23.080
Wh-Why do you have that thing?

00:19:24.150 --> 00:19:26.350
Because I'm a genius.

00:19:26.810 --> 00:19:30.490
And then, Gekkou used 
Spell Error to curse me

00:19:30.490 --> 00:19:32.630
and force me into a contract.

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:34.910
What's worse is...

00:19:34.910 --> 00:19:37.750
Gekkou has to kiss me 
to remove the seal.

00:19:37.750 --> 00:19:39.140
Isn't that mean?

00:19:39.140 --> 00:19:40.780
H-Huh?

00:19:40.780 --> 00:19:42.030
Where's Gekkou?

00:19:50.190 --> 00:19:52.150
Did I surprise you?

00:19:52.880 --> 00:19:55.320
Who are you?

00:19:56.220 --> 00:19:59.000
Yes, who am I?

00:20:01.250 --> 00:20:03.750
It doesn't matter since 
you'll be leaving shortly.

00:20:05.650 --> 00:20:07.070
Whoa, hold on!

00:20:07.070 --> 00:20:08.550
Exorcise: Spell Error!

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:12.930
Just kidding.

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:18.580
Sorry, I didn't feel a thing.

00:20:19.240 --> 00:20:21.530
Spell Error doesn't work?!

00:20:27.670 --> 00:20:29.180
As if.

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:33.170
Impossible!

00:20:33.780 --> 00:20:36.140
Don't lose your cool, Gekkou-chan.

00:20:37.730 --> 00:20:41.090
Geez, he left without telling me.

00:20:41.090 --> 00:20:42.520
Stupid Gekkou.

00:20:46.990 --> 00:20:50.440
Anyway, I have a message 
for you from Hinata.

00:20:57.180 --> 00:21:00.900
W-We're alone now...

00:21:01.660 --> 00:21:02.390
Tha—

00:21:03.930 --> 00:21:05.420
That's right...

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:19.930
Red rain?

00:21:22.410 --> 00:21:26.390
Huh? I just blacked out...

00:21:26.390 --> 00:21:28.660
Let's go find shelter, Taito.

00:21:28.660 --> 00:21:29.810
Himea?

00:21:30.660 --> 00:21:35.760
You didn't notice, but you've already 
died twice because of this rain.

00:21:46.960 --> 00:21:50.450
I killed Hinata myself...

00:21:52.530 --> 00:21:55.780
I'll repeat what Hinata said.

00:21:56.310 --> 00:22:00.280
Don't bother trying to 
tame Saitohimea, brother.

00:22:00.920 --> 00:22:04.960
A fool like you can't 
handle that crazy witch.

00:22:04.960 --> 00:22:08.630
Especially if you're only 
doing it to irritate me.

00:22:09.000 --> 00:22:11.500
Well, you probably won't listen,

00:22:11.500 --> 00:22:17.110
so I have a warning in case you're 
daft enough to keep her around.

00:22:17.110 --> 00:22:20.250
Beware the moon's encroachment.

00:22:22.980 --> 00:22:24.680
I see how it is...

00:22:25.810 --> 00:22:27.560
Very well, Hinata.

00:22:27.930 --> 00:22:29.720
I'm willing to

00:22:30.210 --> 00:22:31.490
play your game.

00:24:10.810 --> 00:24:13.130
Hey! It's Mirai!

00:24:13.130 --> 00:24:15.720
Um, what was I gonna say?

00:24:15.720 --> 00:24:17.220
Hmm...

00:24:17.220 --> 00:24:20.470
Oh, I'm a really strong demon!

00:24:20.470 --> 00:24:23.930
And I'm descended from 
a super famous demon!

00:24:23.930 --> 00:24:27.690
My mommy always said that I was great!

00:24:27.690 --> 00:24:30.560
But Gekkou always calls me trash.

00:24:30.560 --> 00:24:33.210
I said that I'm not trash!

00:24:33.210 --> 00:24:35.530
But then... Well...

00:24:35.180 --> 00:24:39.980
Next Time: "The Tenma Yet Unsung"

00:24:35.530 --> 00:24:36.640
Um...

00:24:36.640 --> 00:24:37.450
Huh?

00:24:37.450 --> 00:24:39.190
What was I gonna say?
